    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are pleased to bring to the market this three bedroom semi - detached bungalow on a large corner site which is ideal for those starting out or those about to sit back and enjoy life. \n\nThis home offers a bright, light filled and cleverly designed layout. It also boasts an array of modern features / extras, fresh neutral decor and a delightful low maintenance render. \n\nCoill Dubh village and all amenities are within easy walking distance including shops, school, church, and a host of excellent recreational facilities. Dublin city and its surrounding areas are easily accessible via a frequent bus service, rail links from nearby Sallins and Maynooth combined with convenience to both the M4 and M7 motorways.\n\nThis is a great opportunity to view an excellent home in a convenient setting with ease of access to all local services and close to larger towns and the city.\n\nWoodlands Park is a well maintained development located adjacent to Coill Dubh village where you can avail of a host of local amenities and services whilst Dublin city and its surrounding areas are easily accessible via a frequent bus service, rail links from Sallins and Maynooth combined with convenience to the M4 and M7 motorways.\n\nViewing is highly recommended\n\nRegister on https://www.mysherryfitz.ie/buyers/sign_in#register to place offers"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1 x 1.3\nWith tiled floor.\n\nEntrance Hall - 7.8m x 1.0m\nWith decorative tiled flooring, coved ceiling, alarm keypad, airing cupboard and attic hatch.\n\nLiving Room - 4.8m x 3.7m\nWith feature fireplace, oak flooring, coved ceiling, bay window, tv point, lightfittings, coved ceiling, built in display unit, double doors to kitchen/dining.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.6m x 3.7m\nWith extensive fitted kitchen units, electric oven, hob, extractor hood, dishwasher, washing machine, wood flooring (dining area), and rear door access.\n\nBedroom 1 - 13.9m x 2.85m\nMaster Bedroom to front with fitted wardrobes, en-suite bathroom off.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.8m x 0.9m\nWith Triton electric shower, wc, whb, tiled walls splashback.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.9m x 2.25m\nTo back with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.0m x 2.8m\nTo back.\n\nShower Room - 1.9m x 1.7m\nWheelchair accessible, fully tiled with shower, seat, wc, whb, extractor fan.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Built 2003.</li><li>Size. 87sqm.</li><li>Oil heating. </li><li>Double glazed windows.</li><li>Corner house.</li><li>Outside power, light and tap.</li><li>Large patio and garden to rear & large side access.</li><li>Included: Barna shed, kitchen appliances, furniture (sold as seen).</ul>"
      },
